  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Query\'s Focus**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the user\'s request. The key is understanding the user\'s prompt: \"SANJEEVANI TRIAGE - COMPLETE END-TO-END PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT MASTER PROMPT.\" I\'m dissecting its components: the application domain (healthcare), the technical aspects (native mobile, AI, intelligent triage), and the overall goal (complete product development). My focus is to break down the user\'s needs to ensure I provide a relevant response.\n\n\n**Defining System Scope**\n\nI\'m now identifying the scope of the system based on the specifications. I need to design for the given environment constraints of port 3000 and the React SPA on Vite setup. I\'m focusing on the integration of both the front-end (patient mobile app) and back-end (orchestration server) components, ensuring they align perfectly with the user\'s detailed requirements including endpoints and functionality.\n\n\n**Defining API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the precise API endpoints required for the system. I\'m taking into consideration specific endpoints, such as `/sos/:id/context`, `/api/v1/hospitals`, `/api/v1/tokens`, `/api/v1/admin/dashboard`, and `/api/v1/admin/queue`. I need to ensure seamless integration with the Google Gemini API using the `gemini-3.8-flash` model, as specified. Furthermore, I will create a detailed Hospital Admin Dashboard (Next/React) with real-time patient queue sorting, filters, queue management, and live updates.\n\n\n**Implementing Server Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the backend routes using Express and ensuring that the server entry point is a `server.ts` file, as specified. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the `/api/v1/*` routes, including authentication, triage (handling multimodal audio, language detection, severity assessment, and hospital allocation), and prescription scanning (extracting information and enforcing safety rules). I\'m also ensuring the correct deployment configuration with `npm run build` and `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`.\n\n\n**Refining Endpoint Specifications**\n\nI\'m now refining the endpoint specifications with more precision. I\'m focusing on the additional routes: `/api/v1/sos-dispatch`, `/api/v1/sos/:id/context`, `/api/v1/sos/history`, and `/api/v1/hospitals/recommend`. I am considering implementing an algorithm to recommend hospitals, as well as routes related to OPD tokens, admin dashboard functions, and health insights. I\'m prioritizing real-time queue synchronization via SSE or WebSockets.\n\n\n"
