  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the interactive components. I\'ve reviewed the requirements for `MobileHeader.tsx`, focusing on the patient greeting, language selector, avatar, and location tag. Next, I\'ll analyze `DailyHealthInsightCard.tsx`, specifically considering the daily step count and sleep data integration. I\'m keen to ensure seamless user interaction.\n\n\n**Analyzing Component Features**\n\nI\'ve been evaluating the components `VoiceTriageSheet.tsx`, `PrescriptionScannerSheet.tsx`, and `SOSEmergencyButton.tsx`. I\'m focusing on the voice triage sheet\'s audio recording, quick-test speech presets in Telugu, Hindi, and English, and the result modal with OPD token generation. I\'m also assessing the prescription scanner\'s camera view and clarity checks. Finally, I\'m examining the SOS button\'s interaction for emergency situations.\n\n\n**Evaluating Emergency Response Features**\n\nI\'m now deep in the features related to emergency response. I\'m focusing on the hold-to-activate progress ring for the SOS button, haptic feedback, and the cancellation mechanism if released under 2.5 seconds. I need to consider the 10-second local audio siren, the 20-second ambient recording, and the live dispatch status integration. I\'m also analyzing the hospital admin view for queue management with SOS cards at the top.\n\n\n**Developing Priority Display Systems**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the visual hierarchy and information presentation, specifically the OPD card system. I\'m prioritizing the implementation of the tier 2 OPD cards based on severity scores, clearly displaying department indicators and real-time status updates. Furthermore, I\'m working on the design for live SSE updates with a \"Live Synced\" indicator. Finally, I\'m integrating a Patient Callback Modal featuring a dialer and emergency contacts.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7418194165268161657"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Activity, Moon, Heart, CloudSun, Info } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { DailyHealthInsight } from \'../../types\';\\n\\ninterface Props {\\n  insight: DailyHealthInsight | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport const DailyHealthInsightCard: React.FC<Props> = ({ insight }) => {\\n  if (!insight) return null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-900/10 via-slate-900/5 to-teal-800/10 border border-teal-500/20 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-teal-600/20 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <Activity className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-wide uppercase\\\">Daily Health Insight</h3>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n              <CloudSun className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-amber-500\\\" /> {insight.context.weather} \342\200\242 {insight.context.location}\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <span className=\\\"text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-400 border border-slate-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-50\\\">\\n          Simulated Health Connect\\n        </span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-3\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-center\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">Steps</div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5\\\">\\n            {insight.metrics.steps.toLocaleString()}\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[9px] text-teal-600 font-semibold\\\">Goal: 8,000</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-center\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-1\\\">\\n            <Moon className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-indigo-500\\\" /> Sleep\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5\\\">\\n            {insight.metrics.sleep_duration_hours} <span className=\\\"text-xs font-normal\\\">hrs</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[9px] text-amber-600 font-semibold\\\">Low (-2.3h)</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-center\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-1\\\">\\n            <Heart className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-rose-500\\\" /> Avg HR\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mt-0.5\\\">\\n            {insight.metrics.avg_hr_bpm} <span className=\\\"text-xs font-normal\\\">bpm</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"text-[9px] text-emerald-600 font-semibold\\\">Resting: Normal</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n        <Info className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n        <p className=\\\"text-[11px]\\\">{insight.observation}</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create daily health insight card with simulated health metrics and contextual observations\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/mobile/DailyHealthInsightCard.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing daily health insight card\",\"toolSummary\":\"Daily health insight card component\"}"
