  user_input {
    user_response: "integrate these features."
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add voice conversations\"\nicon: \"audio_spark\"\n---\n\nAdd functionality to the app for users to use model gemini-3.8-live (Live API) in their app. This will allow users to have a conversation with the app and get responses from Live API in real-time."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add a Gemini chatbot\"\nicon: \"voice_chat\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add a multi-turn chat interface to the app using Gemini. The chat must maintain conversation history, display messages in a scrollable thread, and include a system instruction to give the chatbots specific roles. Use gemini-4-argon for particularly complex tasks, gemini-3.8-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add a SQL database\"\nicon: \"database\"\n---\n\nI want to use a SQL database (Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL) in this app. You **MUST** use the cloudsql-setup (/skills/system_skills/cloudsql-setup/SKILL.md) skill to provision and configure the database."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "integrate these features."
    }
  }
}
