  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Eligibility**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the output from `CheckFeatureEligibility`, specifically when eligibility is false due to \"NO_VALID_PROJECT.\" I\'m cross-referencing this with the `cloudsql-setup` instructions to understand the defined actions for ineligible scenarios.\n\n\n**Refining Pivot Logic**\n\nI\'m now refining the logic for the Firebase pivot. Initially, my plan was to call `set_up_firebase` and immediately stop the Cloud SQL setup, but the Firebase setup has a more nuanced flow. I\'m focusing on \"userConfirmedTermsAcceptedInUI: false\" parameter when calling `set_up_firebase`, which requires a more cautious approach to the transition, as the setup isn\'t automatic as initially thought. I also need to make sure to wait for the user acceptance/rejection message.\n\n\n"
