  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Firebase Integration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the Firebase integration specifics for the `firebase-integration-rpc` skill. I need to generate the necessary `firebase-blueprint.json` and `firestore.rules` files, then deploy the rules using the `deploy_firebase` tool.\n\n\n**Defining Firebase Schemas**\n\nI\'ve outlined the data entities for `firebase-blueprint.json`, including `users`, `triage_records`, `opd_tokens`, `sos_events`, `prescriptions`, and `chat_conversations` and `chat_messages`. Each entity has a set of clearly defined fields, encompassing user details, triage information, tokens, emergency event details, prescription information, and chat conversation elements, which will inform the schema definition.\n\n\n"
