  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding New Cards**\n\nI\'m currently focused on integrating the Live API Voice Conversation card and the Multi-turn Gemini Chatbot card. I\'ve begun implementation with the initial structural setup and components. I\'m exploring the best approach for seamless integration, and the grid layout is proving effective.\n\n\n**Integrating Voice Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Live API Voice Call card. I\'ve completed the initial setup and am focusing on UI elements and basic functionality. I\'m prioritizing user experience and will soon move to API connection and error handling. I\'m making sure it\'s visually appealing and intuitive.\n\n\n**Refining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now refining the UI for the \"Talk Live\" and \"AI Health Chat\" cards. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and visual consistency across both elements. The goal is a clean, intuitive layout, optimizing user experience by balancing information density and ease of use. I\'m making sure it aligns with the overall design language.\n\n\n"
