  planner_response {
    response: "# Integration Complete: Sanjeevani Triage Enhanced Capabilities\n\nWe have integrated all three requested capabilities into the application:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Real-Time Voice Conversations (`gemini-3.8-live` via Live API)\n- **Bidirectional Streaming**: Configured `ai.live.connect` with `model: \"gemini-3.8-live\"`, `responseModalities: [Modality.AUDIO]`, and Zephyr voice profile.\n- **WebSocket Bridge**: Mounted a real-time streaming WebSocket server (`/api/live`) in `server.ts` that receives 16kHz linear PCM audio from the client and streams back 24kHz audio from Gemini.\n- **Client Voice UI (`GeminiLiveVoiceModal.tsx`)**:\n  - Live 16kHz microphone capture via Web Audio `ScriptProcessorNode`.\n  - Gapless 24kHz audio chunk playback with timestamp tracking (`nextStartTime`).\n  - Active audio visualization orb and interrupt handling.\n  - Accessible via the **\"Live Voice\"** button in the header and the **\"Live Voice Call\"** card on the patient mobile screen.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Multi-Turn Gemini Healthcare Chatbot\n- **Multi-Turn Chat History**: Preserves the complete conversation thread across turns (`user` and `model` role mapping) with scrollable chat view.\n- **Model Selection**:\n  - \342\232\241 **`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`**: Fast response time for rapid triage and brief symptom checks.\n  - \360\237\251\272 **`gemini-3.8-flash`**: General healthcare guidance, medication explanations, and department routing.\n  - \360\237\247\240 **`gemini-4-argon`**: Complex clinical reasoning, multisystem analysis, and drug interaction checks.\n- **Role-Based System Instructions**:\n  - *General Health Guide*: Multilingual compassionate advice with medical disclaimers.\n  - *Clinical Specialist*: Differential considerations and in-depth reasoning.\n  - *Rapid Triage Bot*: Quick 3-sentence red-flag checks.\n- **Quick Multilingual Prompts**: Telugu, Hindi, and English preset queries.\n- **Accessible Everywhere**: Available via the **\"AI Chat\"** button in the top navigation and the mobile home screen.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Database Integration (Cloud SQL Setup & Firestore Deployment)\n- **Eligibility & Database Provisioning**: Completed the `CheckFeatureEligibility` evaluation and provisioned the database for persistent storage (Project ID: `gen-lang-client-0659443606`).\n- **Data Modeling (`firebase-blueprint.json`)**: Configured entities for `UserProfile`, `TriageRecord`, `OPDToken`, `SOSEvent`, and `ChatMessage`.\n- **Security Rules (`firestore.rules`)**: Applied zero-trust rules with default deny, path validation (`isValidId`), and collection boundaries; successfully deployed to the project via `deploy_firebase`.\n- **Persistence**: Chat messages and triage records are synchronized to Firestore (`chat_messages` and `triage_records` collections) with offline fallback."
    modified_response: "# Integration Complete: Sanjeevani Triage Enhanced Capabilities\n\nWe have integrated all three requested capabilities into the application:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Real-Time Voice Conversations (`gemini-3.8-live` via Live API)\n- **Bidirectional Streaming**: Configured `ai.live.connect` with `model: \"gemini-3.8-live\"`, `responseModalities: [Modality.AUDIO]`, and Zephyr voice profile.\n- **WebSocket Bridge**: Mounted a real-time streaming WebSocket server (`/api/live`) in `server.ts` that receives 16kHz linear PCM audio from the client and streams back 24kHz audio from Gemini.\n- **Client Voice UI (`GeminiLiveVoiceModal.tsx`)**:\n  - Live 16kHz microphone capture via Web Audio `ScriptProcessorNode`.\n  - Gapless 24kHz audio chunk playback with timestamp tracking (`nextStartTime`).\n  - Active audio visualization orb and interrupt handling.\n  - Accessible via the **\"Live Voice\"** button in the header and the **\"Live Voice Call\"** card on the patient mobile screen.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Multi-Turn Gemini Healthcare Chatbot\n- **Multi-Turn Chat History**: Preserves the complete conversation thread across turns (`user` and `model` role mapping) with scrollable chat view.\n- **Model Selection**:\n  - \342\232\241 **`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`**: Fast response time for rapid triage and brief symptom checks.\n  - \360\237\251\272 **`gemini-3.8-flash`**: General healthcare guidance, medication explanations, and department routing.\n  - \360\237\247\240 **`gemini-4-argon`**: Complex clinical reasoning, multisystem analysis, and drug interaction checks.\n- **Role-Based System Instructions**:\n  - *General Health Guide*: Multilingual compassionate advice with medical disclaimers.\n  - *Clinical Specialist*: Differential considerations and in-depth reasoning.\n  - *Rapid Triage Bot*: Quick 3-sentence red-flag checks.\n- **Quick Multilingual Prompts**: Telugu, Hindi, and English preset queries.\n- **Accessible Everywhere**: Available via the **\"AI Chat\"** button in the top navigation and the mobile home screen.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Database Integration (Cloud SQL Setup & Firestore Deployment)\n- **Eligibility & Database Provisioning**: Completed the `CheckFeatureEligibility` evaluation and provisioned the database for persistent storage (Project ID: `gen-lang-client-0659443606`).\n- **Data Modeling (`firebase-blueprint.json`)**: Configured entities for `UserProfile`, `TriageRecord`, `OPDToken`, `SOSEvent`, and `ChatMessage`.\n- **Security Rules (`firestore.rules`)**: Applied zero-trust rules with default deny, path validation (`isValidId`), and collection boundaries; successfully deployed to the project via `deploy_firebase`.\n- **Persistence**: Chat messages and triage records are synchronized to Firestore (`chat_messages` and `triage_records` collections) with offline fallback."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\250\002\n\245\002\001i\024}\023\362\373\177\276A\376\256\b\'\206\b\253\204/\242\350\243h\203\323@\312\216\303\003\343\372\251E\021\210\021\337\346\333\200\263\327\365\242\300\037\f5`\f\227\022\004\023\363\223\327\0167Hi\252M\202H.\321\236\005\267X\222P\234\223\223\236J\253\210\346\352o\367\365\220\215r\260!\n\240J8<1\372\335\252w \311\n\037\215n\272\\\307i\"+\251z\033\374I\302\020\265o\250t\004\273\031\321\227\220<\254\371nk\347\320\343R\325^\331 o|\326l\364\271\017\327\333\321\252\276\016k\323O\263[$\3228LD\023\322\001\264\242\260\210\364\323\364\352H\333\353\231aZ\371q\375\1778O\375\346\371U\330\366-\275IU\272b\237F%\2413\357\024t\377:U\246\365\231\357#\200ke\267L\024\332\306\315\034\177\234j\233\\j(Rd\226a\313\236\341+\311\006\322>\263\216\311\3351\263\355F\bCI\006\276v\246a\003A\273\307n(\027\0048\313\204\375\217\226D\222?\0212\275\227\373\347.QK0\243yU\300"
