  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Access Rules**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining access rules within `firestore.rules`. My immediate concern is the `chat_conversations/{convId}` path. I\'m considering allowing `delete`, `read`, and `write` operations for both the `chat_conversations` collection and the `chat_messages` subcollection. The initial structure is being drafted now, but the nuances are still under consideration.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1418715460233807521"
