    thinking: "**Analyzing Current Progress**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the integration of the AI health chat feature. It\'s clear that it isn\'t implemented correctly yet. I also need to incorporate the chat history functionality. Furthermore, the application language must dynamically adjust when the user selects a new language. These are the key areas I\'m addressing now.\n\n\n**Inspecting File Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving into the file structure. I\'m checking `src/App.tsx`, `MobileAppView.tsx`, and the other mentioned components to understand how they currently handle language translations. Specifically, I\'m verifying if `LanguageProvider` is correctly wrapping the root and if `useLanguage()` is being used consistently across the application. I\'m also confirming that there are no hardcoded strings. This will help me resolve the language change issue.\n\n\n"
