  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing MobileAppView Logic**\n\nI\'ve been examining `MobileAppView.tsx` and noticed an inconsistency. Initially, the code determined the current language using `profile?.preferred_language || \'te\'`, which seems to bypass the `useLanguage()` hook. It appears the language context, and thus the value, is updated by user selection from the header or mobile app directly. I am currently considering a better option.\n\n\n"
