  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Hardcoded Strings**\n\nI\'m now diving into `src/components/mobile/VoiceTriageSheet.tsx`. My current focus is identifying and isolating hardcoded strings. I found the modal title, \"Voice-to-Token OPD\", needs localization, and also a sentence instructing the user to \"Speak naturally in Telugu, Hindi or English\". Both seem ripe for parameterization.\n\n\n"
