y tabs.\n  - **Hospital Admin Command Center**: Live queue headers, dynamic severity rankings, department filters, and verified callback controls.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Native AI Health Chat Integration & Chat History\n- **First-Class Mobile Chat Tab**: Added a dedicated `Chat` tab directly into the patient mobile app bottom navigation bar. Patients can converse directly inside the mobile frame without needing to open external modals.\n- **Full-Screen Desktop / Quick Launch Modal**: Retained the quick launcher from the top bar and home card for multi-tasking.\n- **Firestore-Synced Conversation History**:\n  - Implemented persistent conversation storage (`chatStorage.ts`) backed by Firestore collection `/chat_conversations` and fast local cache.\n  - **History Drawer**: Shows all previous chat sessions with titles, timestamps, message counts, and one-click resumption or deletion.\n  - **\"+ New Chat\"**: Starts a fresh multi-turn session with native-language greetings.\n- **Model & Persona Customization**:\n  - Model selector supporting `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` (rapid guidance), `gemini-3.8-flash` (balanced reasoning), and `gemini-4-argon` (complex multi-condition clinical reasoning).\n  - Role selection for *General Health Guide*, *Clinical Specialist*, and *Rapid Triage Bot*.\n- **Native Language Instruction Engine**: Gemini automatically detects the user\'s active language and replies naturally in Telugu script, Devanagari Hindi, or English.\n- **OPD Triage Shortcut**: When the AI recognizes conditions requiring physical evaluation, a one-tap `\"Get OPD Token for this\"` button appears directly inside the chat bubble to immediately route the patient to the nearest hospital."
